exports[`examples/diff-view.ts > renders every example 1`] = `
"
Attribute quotes — single-line edit, only the two quote characters are marked

app/views/gems/index.html.erb

      1 │ <div id="gems">
  -   2 │   <span class='card'>Hello</span>
  +     │   <span class="card">Hello</span>
      3 │ </div>

Missing alt attribute — pure insertion, nothing is marked on the removed side

app/views/gems/index.html.erb

      1 │ <div id="gems">
  -   2 │   <img src="a.png">
  +     │   <img src="a.png" alt="">
      3 │ </div>

Re-indent a block — three lines for three, the inserted indentation is marked on each

app/views/gems/index.html.erb

      1 │ <div>
  -   2 │ <span>one</span>
  -   3 │ <span>two</span>
  -   4 │ <span>three</span>
  +     │   <span>one</span>
  +     │   <span>two</span>
  +     │   <span>three</span>
      5 │ </div>

Wrap content in a new element — one line removed, three added

app/views/gems/index.html.erb

      1 │ <div>
  -   2 │   <span>content</span>
  +     │   <section>
  +     │     <span>content</span>
  +     │   </section>
      3 │ </div>

Collapse a multi-line tag — three lines into one, too dissimilar to refine so no inline marks

app/views/gems/index.html.erb

      1 │ <div>
  -   2 │   <span
  -   3 │     class="card"
