  +     │   <span class="a">one</span>
      3 │   <p>filler</p>
        │ ⋮
      6 │   <p>filler</p>
  -   7 │   <span class='b'>two</span>
  +     │   <span class="b">two</span>
      8 │ </div>

ERB block — quoting and spacing inside an ERB expression

app/views/gems/index.html.erb

      1 │ <% @gems.each do |gem| %>
  -   2 │   <%= render partial: 'gem_card', locals: {gem: gem} %>
  +     │   <%= render partial: "gem_card", locals: { gem: gem } %>
      3 │ <% end %>


Single-line collapsing (singleLineStyle)
  auto collapses a pair only when the composite reads better than two lines: always for a pure
  insertion or deletion, and for a replacement only while the change stays short, stays a
  minority of the line, and still fits the width.
  Needs color: without it every style falls back to split, since only the tinting tells old from new.


Pure insertion — the composite is the real new line, nothing synthetic

  split
        1 │ <div>
    -   2 │   <img src="a.png">
    +     │   <img src="a.png" alt="">
        3 │   <p>untouched</p>

  inline
        1 │ <div>
    ±   2 │   <img src="a.png" alt="">
        3 │   <p>untouched</p>

  auto
        1 │ <div>
    ±   2 │   <img src="a.png" alt="">
        3 │   <p>untouched</p>


Replacement — the composite carries text that is in neither version, readable only by its tinting

  split
        1 │ <div>
    -   2 │   <span class='a'>one</span>
    +     │   <span class="a">one</span>
        3 │   <p>untouched</p>

  inline
        1 │ <div>
